OL,3,CWoman admits 'passionate kiss' with
OL,4,Cboy, court hears
OL,6,FA woman accused of having sex with an
OL,7,Funderage boy in the 1990s has told
OL,8,FJersey's Royal Court that she shared a
OL,9,F"passionate kiss" with him but did not
OL,10,Fbelieve he was under 16.
OL,12,FDonna Marie Bentley, 53, denies all
OL,13,Fthe alleged historical sexual
OL,14,Foffences: four counts of procuring an
OL,15,Fact of gross indecency and two counts
OL,16,Fof indecent assault.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/6
