OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1785518371
OL,3,CWoman admits 'passionate kiss' with
OL,4,Cboy, court hears
OL,6,FThe court previously heard the alleged
OL,7,Fvictim claim that Ms Bentley had got
OL,8,Finto bed with him while he was
OL,9,Fsleeping and had sex with him when he
OL,10,Fsays he was aged 14 - one of two
OL,11,Foccasions he alleges they had
OL,12,Fintercourse.
OL,14,FOn Wednesday 29 July, Ms Bentley took
OL,15,Fto the stand and told the jury her and
OL,16,Fthe boy had kissed after she had been
OL,17,Fdrinking heavily and smoking cannabis,
OL,18,Fbut that she thought he was 16 or 17
OL,19,Fyears old.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
