PN,35703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1785518371
OL,3,CWoman admits 'passionate kiss' with
OL,4,Cboy, court hears
OL,6,FShe says she embraced the teenager and
OL,7,Fcannot recall who initiated the kiss -
OL,8,Fwhich she says went no further.
OL,10,FMs Bentley states she cannot remember
OL,11,Fmuch of the night but rejects they had
OL,12,Fsex and also claims the alleged victim
OL,13,Fwas awake when she entered the room.
OL,15,FShe explains she felt embarrassed and
OL,16,Fashamed of her actions the following
OL,17,Fday, saying she felt as though she had
OL,18,Foverstepped the mark by kissing the
OL,19,Fteenager.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/6
