CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1785518371
OL,3,CWoman admits 'passionate kiss' with
OL,4,Cboy, court hears
OL,6,FThe defendant also claims she woke up
OL,7,Fin the boy's bed that morning fully
OL,8,Fclothed.
OL,10,FMs Bentley denies that there was a
OL,11,Fsecond occasion of any physical
OL,12,Fcontact.
OL,14,FShe was originally arrested after
OL,15,Fgoing to the police about messages she
OL,16,Fhad received from the alleged victim.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/6
