PN,35705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1785518371
OL,3,CWoman admits 'passionate kiss' with
OL,4,Cboy, court hears
OL,6,FMs Bentley claims that she was shocked
OL,7,Fwhen she started getting messages from
OL,8,Fthe man in 2020 which read: "What you
OL,9,Fdone to me was wrong", and feared she
OL,10,Fwould lose her job.
OL,12,FIn another message, the alleged victim
OL,13,Fsaid: "Do you remember getting into
OL,14,Fbed with me when I was 14?" and in a
OL,15,Fthird: "Why was I abused?"
OL,17,FMs Bentley told the court she was
OL,18,F"traumatised" by what he sent to her
OL,19,Fand says she wondered whether it was a
OL,20,Fscam.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
