PN,35706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1785518371
OL,3,CWoman admits 'passionate kiss' with
OL,4,Cboy, court hears
OL,6,FShe added: "I was horrified, horrified
OL,7,Fas anybody would be.
OL,9,F"I felt fearful and I felt scared."
OL,11,FMs Bentley is a registered care
OL,12,Fmanager in the island and the alleged
OL,13,Foffences do not relate to her
OL,14,Femployment, although she resigned once
OL,15,Fshe was charged.
OL,17,FShe denies all the charges against her
OL,18,Fand the trial continues.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G6/6
